env
venv
.venv
__pycache__
*.py[cod]
.env
# Only bare `.env` was ignored, so the copies a shell redirect leaves behind —
# .env.save, .env.save.1, .env.bak.<date> — sat untracked in the deploy
# directory holding live Nylas, OpenAI and database credentials. One `git add
# -A` on the server would have committed them.
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.bak_*
# atrek is its own repository (makhammatovb/atrek), checked out inside this one
# because deploy.sh expects it at ./agent and calls its deploy script.
/agent/
*.log
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
.claude/
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.aider*
node_modules/
